{"pin":"AB00398","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00398","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art gladdened by the tidings of God! Thy latest letter hath reached me, and I have offered praise unto God for thy safe arrival [3.5s]... ...Grieve thou not over the ascension of my beloved Breakwell, for he hath risen unto a rose garden of splendors within the Abha Paradise","first_line_orig":"ایها المستبشر ببشارات الله قد وصلنی تحریرک الجدید و حمدت الله علی وصولک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"610","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"music","code":"L. Slott","source":"L","locator":"Slott","url":"https://youtu.be/e0s-Tvrlc7w"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0187","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0187","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/172006473"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DSDS.110x","source":"DSDS","locator":"110x"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#158 p.182x","source":"MMK1","locator":"158 p.182x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/116762209"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#159 p.184x","source":"MMK1","locator":"159 p.184x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/408635568"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#040 p.126x","source":"MNMK","locator":"040 p.126x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-124.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#054 p.137x","source":"MNMK","locator":"054 p.137x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-135.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSTW#043ax","source":"BSTW","locator":"043ax","url":"http://www.h-net.org/~bahai/docs/vol13/Barstow_000-050.pdf#page=56"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSTW#052kx","source":"BSTW","locator":"052kx","url":"http://www.h-net.org/~bahai/docs/vol13/Barstow_051-100.pdf#page=5"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BWF.387-388x","source":"BWF","locator":"387-388x","